<!--
    :feature-home copy (CP-12 §7.9 / CP-11 §7.5 = design §17, verbatim; CP-00A §5.3 derived keys). CP-12a (SS-13):
    header, status block, banner, states. CP-11 adds chart and tooltip copy; CP-12b adds the counter, doughnut, FAB
    and S-02 Snackbar keys.
    Shared keys used here but owned by :ui-core: s01_reading_empty, s01_age_*, trend_*, a11y_* (CP-06) and
    s06_snackbar_saved („Connection saved”, CP-12 §7.8 — next to UiMessage, Moderator ruling SS-13).
    Placeholders: {n} → %1$d; {x.x} → %1$s (formatted in code, one decimal).
-->
