    <!--
        Reading group for TalkBack (§7.11; CP-00A §5.3 „Glucose {sgv} milligrams per decilitre, {trend}, {age}[, IOB
        {iob} units]”; Q-86: the range word follows the value when a label is shown). The optional fragments are
        appended in a fixed order: %2$s = range part (s01_status_a11y_range with an s01_range_* word, or empty),
        %5$s = IOB part (s01_status_a11y_iob, or empty). {sgv} → %1$d, {trend} → %3$s, {age} → %4$s.
    -->
